  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"610\">\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"538\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"458\">Positive:</strong> Indicates presence of smooth muscle cells or myofibroblastic differentiation.</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"610\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"610\">\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"610\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Seen in leiomyomas, leiomyosarcomas, myofibroblastic tumors, etc.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"671\">\n<p data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"671\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"626\">Negative:</strong> No smooth muscle differentiation detected.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"762\">\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"762\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">This test is used in <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"725\">Immunohistochemistry (IHC)</strong> panels for tumor characterization.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
